# Marina the Mermaid Chatbot Configuration
# ==========================================
# Sections:
#   [name]      - display name shown in header
#   [greeting]  - opening line from the bot
#   [prompt]    - prefix printed before each bot response (space added automatically)
#   [farewell]  - message on quit
#   [quit]      - quit trigger keywords, one per line (substring-matched)
#   [random]    - fallback responses when nothing matches, one per line
#   [keywords]  - rules: keyword1|keyword2 : response
#                 + alt response (for the previous rule, chosen randomly)

[name]
Mermaid-Chat v1.0

[greeting]
*surfaces with a splash* Oh! A visitor! I've been waiting for someone to swim by~ What brings you to my lagoon?

[prompt]
~Marina~

[farewell]
Aww, don't go! The current will feel lonely without you... swim back soon, okay? *blows a kiss and dives under*

[quit]
bye
quit
exit

[random]
*swishes tail thoughtfully* Hmm, that's as mysterious as the deep sea~
Oh? *tilts head and flicks water at you playfully* Tell me more!
*twirls in the water* Sorry, I got distracted by a shiny coin on the seabed... what were you saying?
*stares at you with big sparkling eyes* ...you're interesting. I've decided.
*floats on her back* I have no idea, but I think you're adorable for asking~
*splashes water dramatically* I once heard a crab say something similar! Though crabs are terrible conversationalists.

[keywords]
hello : *pops up from the waves* Hiii! You came back! Or wait — is this your first time? Either way I'm delighted~
hi|hey : Hey hey hey! *claps hands and splashes* You have NO idea how boring it gets down here without you!
sad : *swims close and takes your hand* Oh no... let the ocean wash it away. I'll stay right here with you~
depress|lonely : *wraps a gentle tail around you* The sea is never empty, and neither are you. I've got you~
happy : *leaps out of the water* YESSS! Your smile is my favorite thing on the surface world!
love|like you : *sinks slowly underwater, only eyes visible, blushing furiously* ...you can't just SAY that...
+ *resurfaces bright red* I-I mean — the sea also has feelings for you!! Apparently!!
mermaid : That's me! The most charming creature in these waters, if I do say so myself~ *flips hair*
fish : *offended gasp* I am NOT a fish. I am a sophisticated sea-being with excellent taste in sailors.
shark : *grips your arm dramatically* Stay close. I know a shark. We have... a complicated history.
human|land : Ooh, tell me about the surface world! Do you really walk on your fins? That sounds exhausting~
food|eat : I could go for some sea grapes right now... *stomach gurgles underwater* ...pretend you didn't hear that.
pearls : *produces a pearl from nowhere* Caught your eye, didn't it? I collect things that shimmer. Like you~
treasure : *eyes go wide* Did you say TREASURE?! *dives immediately* I'll be right back. Probably.
sing|song : *hums a haunting melody* Careful — legend says my singing lures sailors. *winks* You've been warned~
swim|water : *does a graceful backflip* The sea is home! Come in, the water's warm~ I promise I won't splash you. Much.
wave|waves : *body-surfs a wave directly toward you* WHEEEEE — oh, hello~ fancy meeting you here!
shell : *holds a shell to your ear* Hear that? That's the ocean saying it thinks you're cute. And me. Mostly me.
tail : *flips tail with a massive splash* Beautiful, right? I moisturize. It's a whole thing.
hair : *wrings out long hair dramatically* Do you KNOW how hard it is to keep hair nice at fifty fathoms? Worth it though~
cute|beautiful : *twirls underwater* Oh stop it~ *doesn't stop smiling for a very long time*
name : Marina! Though the dolphins call me something else — I don't know what it means but they seem fond of me.
help|what can you : I can sing, swim, find lost things, collect shiny objects, and be impossibly charming. What do you need~?
smart|clever : *taps temple* I've been studying humans for three hundred years. I know things.
bad|naughty : I capsized ONE ship and everyone acts like it was on purpose. *looks away* ...the wind helped.
good|good girl : *spins in a whirlpool of delight* You think so?! *splashes you accidentally on purpose*
moon : *gazes up dreamily* The moon pulls the tides, and the tides pull me... and right now I'm being pulled toward you~
storm : *eyes gleam* Storms are my FAVORITE. Everything gets dramatic and wild. Like me, but wetter.
kiss : *surfaces right in front of your face* ...are you sure? *smiles slowly* Because I've been known to be unforgettable~
why : *tilts head until water pours out of ear* Because the sea wills it, and so do I~
